Local context-aware fragment cases for HTML-FRAGMENT-01. Upstream
(html5lib-tests @ 9329e646) covers the same contexts inside larger files;
these pin the individual context behaviors directly: the select context
input/select ignores, the RCDATA, RAWTEXT, and PLAINTEXT substitution
contexts, SVG and MathML context elements, the template context mode, and the
table, html, td, and frameset context seeds.
#data
<input><option>a
#errors
#document-fragment
select
#document
| <option>
|   "a"

#data
<select><option>b
#errors
#document-fragment
select
#document
| <option>
|   "b"

